WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.636
Environmental factors shape drone safety, control, endurance, navigation, data quality,

00:00:04.636 --> 00:00:05.997
and mission outcomes.

00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:10.080
Wind, temperature, moisture, visibility, lighting, terrain, obstacles, radio conditions,

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.709
and navigation signals interact rather than acting alone.

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:18.699
Evaluate forecasts, current site conditions, aircraft and payload guidance, crew capability,

00:00:18.699 --> 00:00:21.874
route, margins, and emergency options before flight.

00:00:21.874 --> 00:00:27.772
Average wind or a battery percentage by itself does not describe operational risk.

00:00:27.772 --> 00:00:32.761
During flight, monitor gusts, power use, visibility, image quality, navigation behavior,

00:00:32.761 --> 00:00:35.937
signal trends, obstacles, and changing ground activity.

00:00:35.937 --> 00:00:38.205
Recover early when margins narrow.

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:41.834
Automated avoidance and return functions remain limited tools.

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:45.917
Record weather, site observations, decisions, deviations, alerts, and outcome.

00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:50.453
Use after-action review to improve future thresholds, maintenance, collection timing,

00:00:50.453 --> 00:00:51.814
and crew briefings.

00:00:51.814 --> 00:00:53.628
Remember that risks compound.

00:00:53.628 --> 00:00:57.711
Moderate wind, cold battery performance, weak signal, difficult terrain,

00:00:57.711 --> 00:01:03.155
and fading light may each appear manageable alone while their combined effect

00:01:03.155 --> 00:01:06.784
removes the margin needed for a controlled return.

00:01:06.784 --> 00:01:09.959
The goal is safe, lawful, conservative operation,

00:01:09.959 --> 00:01:13.135
not forcing a mission through unsafe conditions.

00:01:13.135 --> 00:01:18.578
A delay or cancellation is successful risk management when the environment cannot

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.300
support controlled flight and useful data.
